        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry Lee Lucas, Ottis Toole, Ottis Elwood Toole\n- Works: Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer\n- Concepts: Serial killers, fictional characters\n\nFacts:\n- Ottis Elwood Toole was born on March 5, 1947, and died on September 15, 1996.\n- Ottis Elwood Toole was an American drifter and serial killer.\n- Ottis Elwood Toole was convicted of six counts of murder.\n- The film Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer includes the characters Henry and Otis.\n- The characters Henry and Otis in Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer were loosely based on the real-life serial killers Henry Lee Lucas and Ottis Toole.",
